{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103580/extras/1fa2e651df070ef07eade0d7c2ef44dd.avif?t=1766461456\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious dungeon sits in the middle of town, and you're just the adventurers to plumb its depths! Okay, sure, so the townspeople are kind of... unique. And the monsters are... well, they're something. But hey, conquering dungeons always looks good on a resume, right? ...Right? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103580/extras/adddf4969c39297bf05917d947d5fa65.avif?t=1766461456\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve into the dungeon, fight against monsters, and get your hands on the strange relics of an ancient civilization, then sell whatever you find to build your fortune in this dungeon crawler RPG! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103580/extras/32707e023f63d6b1d1cdb8850326b45e.avif?t=1766461456\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103580/extras/aca0d964b4e2e1627d97227899137334.avif?t=1766461456\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103580/extras/010db25a929740e9862fc3b56fd9cbc5.avif?t=1766461456\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103580/extras/04214f5445a8e6030bd6a31bd6c79995.avif?t=1766461456\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103580/extras/91e6ead46a02f80419897283086cefeb.avif?t=1766461456\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Explore the Dungeon</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the many rooms of the dungeon! Collect treasure, earn money, and level up! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Appraise Your Treasures</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take any ancient relics you find to the appraiser and learn more about a lost civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Unravel the Mystery</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one actually knows where the dungeon came from... Will you be the ones to uncover the truth?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103580?t=1766461456","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103580?t=1766461456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103580/b7992d1c149e291ebca8fbfbfadc4ff6be991c41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766461456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103580/b7992d1c149e291ebca8fbfbfadc4ff6be991c41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766461456","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103580/extras/1fa2e651df070ef07eade0d7c2ef44dd.avif?t=1766461456\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious dungeon sits in the middle of town, and you're just the adventurers to plumb its depths! Okay, sure, so the townspeople are k